# Pairs with ListedInSink. A publish does not wait while its own scope retires
# the id: it registers a row the retire then deletes the manifest of (#5418).
MODULE: ListedInSinkAcquireIgnoresRetire
TARGET: ListedInSink
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a publish does not wait for its scope's retire of the id
PERTURBS: Acquire

--- FIND
       /\ held[s] = "free"
       /\ s = "A" => ~Leased
       /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![s] = "pub"]
--- REPLACE
       \* MUTATION: no wait on the scope's hold.
       /\ s = "A" => ~Leased
       /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![s] = IF @ = "ret" THEN "ret" ELSE "pub"]
--- END
